\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is defined. Justify your\nanswer.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch13-psd-and-svd/12-pseudoinverse.html"}